persist_closest with valid_range matching the 2005 on-disk monthly files. The model
run (pass 2) requests 20080615, which is outside valid_range end (2005-12-31).
check_data_availability verifies files exist and passes (found_any is sufficient for
persist_closest outside valid_range). At runtime, ExtData clamps to valid_range(2) and
persists the Dec 15 2005 value (day 348 since 20050101).
